<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps rates Saks convertible notes.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps rates Saks convertible notes.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said on Wednesday it assigned an initial rating of Single B to Saks Holdings Inc's convertible subordinated notes due 2006.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps also assigned a Double B Minus rating to Saks &amp; Co's amended and restated bank revolving credit agreement.</p>
<p>It said recent financial transactions have benefitted Saks' capital structure and financial risk profile.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
